<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gengold Q1 distrib rises to 87.7 mln rand.</title>
<headline>Gengold Q1 distrib rises to 87.7 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter. (Figures exclude Oryx mine, a division of St Helena.)</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distributable income		   87.7  vs 68.9</p>
<p>    Capex					49.92 vs 51.26</p>
<p>    Gold output			     10,182 vs 10,036</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated	    1,718,000 vs 1,699,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     5.9 vs 5.9</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     51,504 vs 55,375</p>
<p>    Working costs (rand/kg)	     41,640 vs 41,728</p>
<p>Full name: Gengold, gold division of Gencor Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
